GoGauge Mobile
==============

This project is an Android/Flutter port of GoGauge:

  GoGauge (opencode-go-gauge)
  Copyright (c) 2026 GoGauge (yphyphyph)
  https://github.com/yphyphyph/opencode-go-gauge
  Licensed under the MIT License.

It is a community-maintained port and is not an official mobile release from
the upstream author. The upstream Windows desktop application is a separate
project and is not included in this repository.

Changes made for the Android port:
- UI rewritten with Flutter/Dart (bottom navigation, mobile layouts, charts,
  light/dark themes, Chinese/English UI).
- opencode.ai console API client, quota parsing, SQLite aggregations and the
  incremental/full sync cursor logic ported from Python to Dart.
- Android in-app WebView login with a native CookieManager bridge for the
  HttpOnly session cookie, plus a manual "paste cookie" fallback.
- Session cookies stored in Android Keystore-backed secure storage instead of
  the SQLite database.
- Added an extra `created_ms` column so date/hour bucketing does not depend on
  SQLite's ISO-8601 timezone parsing.

The MIT license text and the upstream copyright notice are preserved in the
LICENSE file.
